  "title": "Double feather stitch",
  "subtitle": "Two loops to each side instead of one, for a fuller branching column",
  "excerpt": "Double feather stitch works the same rhythm as feather stitch but makes two loops to each side before crossing to the other, producing a wider and more elaborate branching column.",
